# Zod at system boundaries

Parse HTTP JSON, NDJSON, search params, request bodies, and env with Zod. Infer types with `z.infer`. Do not assert types onto serialized data (`as Foo`, `.json<Foo>()`).

On parse failure, throw that boundary's domain error. SQL uses the Drizzle schema; in-process TypeScript does not need Zod.

See `docs/agents/validation.md`.
